/steam/apps/3865440/extras/d3dd8c48d2160532b8b03762ebbf83b8.avif?t=1753280696\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My sins\u2026 they\u2019re still right here. \ud83e\udee6\ud83d\udc94</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And in this house...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Photos \ud83d\udcf7, flash drives \ud83d\udcbe, bedroom scents \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f\ud83c\udf39, sounds, whispers \ud83c\udfb6\ud83d\udca8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything feels like it\u2019s teasing me\u2026 testing my will \ud83e\udee0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865440/extras/d3dd8c48d2160532b8b03762ebbf83b8.avif?t=1753280696\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865440/extras/075c5b530e4bec15a2d8bf9ea0cad639.poster.avif?t=1753280696\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865440/extras/075c5b530e4bec15a2d8bf9ea0cad639.webm?t=1753280696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865440/extras/075c5b530e4bec15a2d8bf9ea0cad639.mp4?t=1753280696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865440/extras/d3dd8c48d2160532b8b03762ebbf83b8.avif?t=1753280696\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc8b <strong>What Awaits You:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>80+ revealing snapshots</strong> that take you back\u2026 or spark something new<br>\ud83d\udd7a <strong>40+ animations</strong>, from playful to deeply intimate<br>\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Videos and scenes</strong> that reveal the girls \u2014 and your feelings toward them<br>\u2615 <strong>Interactable objects</strong> everywhere: guitars, teddy bears, books, coffee machines, flash drives, and more<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Light puzzles and logic</strong> \u2014 you\u2019re not just watching, you\u2019re involved<br>\ud83d\ude0f <strong>An atmosphere where lust and redemption go hand in hand</strong><br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Play at your own pace</strong> \u2014 choose who to follow, where to start, and what to uncover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Sin of Soul</strong> isn\u2019t horror.<br>It\u2019s not your usual visual novel either.<br>It\u2019s a sinfully charming story about second chances \u2014 and how hard it is to be good\u2026<br>especially when you're surrounded by beautiful women, and you\u2019re a ghost with a past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you try to make things right?<br>Or mess it all up again \u2014 with a smile?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The choice is yours. Well\u2026 almost.</strong></p>","developers":["Last Sin of Soul"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865440/b1dd0384bae37734d994a6e6a53b48983d2fb933/header.jpg?t=1753280696","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS\u202f15\u202fSequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Last Sin of Soul","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong